{"issue": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1566", "repository_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK", "labels_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1566/labels{/name}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1566/comments", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1566/events", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1566", "id": 1008228932, "node_id": "I_kwDOBabE0s48GFpE", "number": 1566, "title": "How to connect multiple instances of mavsdk into the same mavlink port?", "user": {"login": "AlbertoUA", "id": 47592046, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NTkyMDQ2", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47592046?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA", "html_url": "https://github.com/AlbertoUA", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "labels": [{"id": 629977272, "node_id": "MDU6TGFiZWw2Mjk5NzcyNzI=", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/labels/question", "name": "question", "color": "cc317c", "default": true, "description": null}], "state": "closed", "locked": false, "assignees": [], "milestone": null, "comments": 6, "created_at": "2021-09-27T14:33:42Z", "updated_at": "2021-09-28T14:06:40Z", "closed_at": "2021-09-28T14:06:40Z", "assignee": null, "author_association": "NONE", "issue_field_values": [], "type": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "sub_issues_summary": {"total": 0, "completed": 0, "percent_completed": 0}, "issue_dependencies_summary": {"blocked_by": 0, "total_blocked_by": 0, "blocking": 0, "total_blocking": 0}, "body": "Hi, I am trying to connect multiple instances of mavsdk into the same mavlink port. In order to do that, I use mavlink router to redirect the data into multiple ports. \r\n\r\n```\r\nmavlink-routerd -e 127.0.0.1:29900 -e 127.0.0.1:19990 127.0.0.1:14540 \r\n```\r\nThen, I connect an instance of mavsdk into each new port using a **connection_url_** of udp://:19990 and udp://:29990.\r\n\r\n```c++\r\n    sdk_ = std::make_shared<mavsdk::Mavsdk>();\r\n\r\n    auto prom = std::promise<std::shared_ptr<mavsdk::System>>{};\r\n    auto fut = prom.get_future();\r\n\r\n    mavsdk::ConnectionResult connection_result;\r\n\r\n    connection_result = sdk_->add_any_connection(connection_url_);\r\n\r\n    if (connection_result != mavsdk::ConnectionResult::Success) {\r\n        RCLCPP_ERROR(this->get_logger(), \"Connection failed:\");\r\n        return false;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    RCLCPP_INFO(this->get_logger(), \"Waiting to discover system ...\");\r\n    auto config = mavsdk::Mavsdk::Configuration(mavsdk::Mavsdk::Configuration::UsageType::CompanionComputer);\r\n    sdk_->set_configuration(config);\r\n    cout << connection_url_ << endl;\r\n    sdk_->subscribe_on_new_system([this, &prom]() {\r\n        auto system = sdk_->systems().back();\r\n        if (system->has_autopilot()) {\r\n            RCLCPP_INFO(this->get_logger(), \"Discovered system\");\r\n            sdk_->subscribe_on_new_system(nullptr);\r\n            prom.set_value(system);\r\n        }\r\n    });\r\n\r\n    if (fut.wait_for(std::chrono::seconds(5)) == std::future_status::timeout) {\r\n        RCLCPP_ERROR(this->get_logger(), \"No Autopilot found:\");\r\n        return false;\r\n    }\r\n```\r\n\r\nWhen I do this, only the first process to connect to a port works while the others are not able to find any system due to a timeout error.\r\n\r\nIs there a way I can connect multiple instances of mavsdk to the same port?", "closed_by": {"login": "AlbertoUA", "id": 47592046, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NTkyMDQ2", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47592046?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA", "html_url": "https://github.com/AlbertoUA", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1566/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "timeline_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1566/timeline", "performed_via_github_app": null, "state_reason": "completed", "pinned_comment": null}, "comments": [{"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/927960503", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1566#issuecomment-927960503", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1566", "id": 927960503, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s43T423", "user": {"login": "JonasVautherin", "id": 2606672, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjI2MDY2NzI=", "avatar_url": "https