"", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA", "html_url": "https://github.com/AlbertoUA", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2021-09-27T15:19:05Z", "updated_at": "2021-09-27T15:19:05Z", "body": "Sorry, I mistyped the command while writing the issue. The mavlink router command I use is:\r\n````\r\nmavlink-routerd -e 127.0.0.1.1:29990 -e 127.0.0.0.1:19990 127.0.0.1:14540\r\n````", "author_association": "NONE", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/927977155/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/927993404", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1566#issuecomment-927993404", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1566", "id": 927993404, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s43UA48", "user": {"login": "JonasVautherin", "id": 2606672, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjI2MDY2NzI=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2606672?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin", "html_url": "https://github.com/JonasVautherin", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2021-09-27T15:37:36Z", "updated_at": "2021-09-27T15:37:36Z", "body": "Then, for what I can see here, it looks good to me :thinking:. Did you try them separately? Is it always the first one that works, or is it always the 29990 that works?", "author_association": "COLLABORATOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/927993404/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/928915155", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1566#issuecomment-928915155", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1566", "id": 928915155, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s43Xh7T", "user": {"login": "AlbertoUA", "id": 47592046, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NTkyMDQ2", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47592046?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA", "html_url": "https://github.com/AlbertoUA", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2021-09-28T07:06:02Z", "updated_at": "2021-09-28T07:06:02Z", "body": "When I try them separately, they both work. However, it is when I try them together that the first process launched always works  and the other fails. I have found that this does not happen all the time, but randomly depending on the execution.\r\n\r\nFor example, I am trying to launch 3 instances of PX4 with ports 14540, 14541 and 14542. And then I using the mavlink router to redirect the data to various ports.\r\n\r\n````\r\nmavlink-routerd -e 127.0.0.1.1.1:29990 -e 127.0.0.0.1:19990 127.0.0.1.1:14540 \r\n\r\nmavlink-routerd -e 127.0.0.0.1.1.1:29991 -e 127.0.0.0.1:19991 127.0.0.1.1:14541 \r\n\r\nmavlink-routerd -e 127.0.0.0.1.1.1:29992 -e 127.0.0.0.1.1:19992 127.0.0.1.1:14542 \r\n````\r\nNext, I connect multiple instances of mavskd processes to these ports in this order\r\n\r\ninstance of process 1 connected to port 29990\r\ninstance of process 1 connected to port 29991\r\ninstance of process 1 connected to port 29992\r\n\r\ninstance of process 2 connected to port 19990\r\ninstance of process 2 connected to port 19991\r\ninstance of process 2 connected to port 19992\r\n\r\nIn this case, all instances of process 1 are running correctly. However, some instances of process 2 will randomly fail because they are not able to find a system. Failing in this if:\r\n\r\n```c++\r\n if (fut.wait_for(std::chrono::seconds(5)) == std::future_status::timeout) {\r\n        RCLCPP_ERROR(this->get_logger(), \"No Autopilot found:\");\r\n        return false;\r\n    }\r\n````\r\nThe processes that fail are random and change between executions.\r\n\r\nI also tried to change the second process to mavros and got the same error (some processes dies randomly sometimes because it doesn't find any system).", "author_association": "NONE", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/928915155/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/929015944", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1566#issuecomment-929015944", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1566", "id": 929015944, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s43X6iI", "user": {"login": "JonasVautherin", "id": 2606672, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjI2MDY2NzI=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2606672?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin", "html_url": "https://github.com/JonasVautherin", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2021-09-28T09:24:46Z", "updated_at": "2021-09-28T09:24:46Z", "body": "One thing I can think of is that your different mavsdk instances should not have the same sysid:compid when connecting to the same drone. Not sure if that is your issue, but if not that will create issues later on, so let's try to change that first.\r\n\r\nI would use [this](https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/blob/main/src/core/mavsdk.h#L205-L206) to set manual sysid:compid (keep the boolean to false in that case)", "author_association": "COLLABORATOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/929015944/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/929264706", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1566#issuecomment-929264706", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1566", "id": 929264706, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s43Y3RC", "user": {"login": "AlbertoUA", "id": 47592046, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NTkyMDQ2", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47592046?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA", "html_url": "https://github.com/AlbertoUA", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2021-09-28T14:06:27Z", "updated_at": "2021-09-28T14:06:27Z", "body": "I was able to find the problem. I used a code similar to the one on the [mission_fly](https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/blob/main/examples/fly_mission/fly_mission.cpp)  example where the system discovery function I has a code similar to this:\r\n```c++\r\nsdk_->subscribe_on_new_system([this, &prom]() {\r\n        auto system = sdk_->systems().back();\r\n        if (system->has_autopilot()) {\r\n````\r\nThis code takes the last system from the list of systems found by mavsdk. This works correctly when there is only one instance of mavsdk running because the autopilot is the only system found. However, when there is another instance from mavsdk running at the same time, this process is also discovered as a ground station without autopilot. As only the last system is processed by the code, no autopilot is found and the process fails.\r\n\r\nI have been able to make it working by iterating through all the systems found by mavsdk.\r\n````c++\r\nsdk_->subscribe_on_new_system([this, &prom]() {\r\n        for (auto const &system: sdk_->systems()) {\r\n            if (system->has_autopilot()) {\r\n````\r\n", "author_association": "NONE", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/929264706/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}], "timeline": [{"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/927960503", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1566#issuecomment-927960503", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1566", "id": 927960503, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s43T423", "user": {"login": "JonasVautherin", "id": 2606672, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjI2MDY2NzI=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2606672?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin", "html_url": "https://github.com/JonasVautherin", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2021-09-27T15:02:01Z", "updated_at": "2021-09-27T15:02:01Z", "body": "> mavlink-routerd -e 127.0.0.1:29900 -e 127.0.0.1:19990 127.0.0.1:14540 \r\n\r\n> udp://:19990 and udp://:29990\r\n\r\nThe ports don't match here. 29900 and 29990 are not the same :innocent: ", "author_association": "COLLABORATOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/927960503/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null, "event": "commented", "actor": {"login": "JonasVautherin", "id": 2606672, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjI2MDY2NzI=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2606672?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin", "html_url": "https://github.com/JonasVautherin", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/927977155", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1566#issuecomment-927977155", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1566", "id": 927977155, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s43T87D", "user": {"login": "AlbertoUA", "id": 47592046, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NTkyMDQ2", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47592046?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA", "html_url": "https://github.com/AlbertoUA", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2021-09-27T15:19:05Z", "updated_at": "2021-09-27T15:19:05Z", "body": "Sorry, I mistyped the command while writing the issue. The mavlink router command I use is:\r\n````\r\nmavlink-routerd -e 127.0.0.1.1:29990 -e 127.0.0.0.1:19990 127.0.0.1:14540\r\n````", "author_association": "NONE", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/927977155/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null, "event": "commented", "actor": {"login": "AlbertoUA", "id": 47592046, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NTkyMDQ2", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47592046?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA", "html_url": "https://github.com/AlbertoUA", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/927993404", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1566#issuecomment-927993404", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1566", "id": 927993404, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s43UA48", "user": {"login": "JonasVautherin", "id": 2606672, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjI2MDY2NzI=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2606672?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin", "html_url": "https://github.com/JonasVautherin", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2021-09-27T15:37:36Z", "updated_at": "2021-09-27T15:37:36Z", "body": "Then, for what I can see here, it looks good to me :thinking:. Did you try them separately? Is it always the first one that works, or is it always the 29990 that works?", "author_association": "COLLABORATOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/927993404/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null, "event": "commented", "actor": {"login": "JonasVautherin", "id": 2606672, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjI2MDY2NzI=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2606672?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin", "html_url": "https://github.com/JonasVautherin", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}}, {"id": 5371381957, "node_id": "LE_lADOBabE0s48GFpEzwAAAAFAKMjF", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/events/5371381957", "actor": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419688?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes", "html_url": "https://github.com/julianoes", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "event": "labeled", "commit_id": null, "commit_url": null, "created_at": "2021-09-28T06:18:18Z", "label": {"name": "question", "color": "cc317c"}, "intent": null, "performed_via_github_app": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/928915155", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1566#issuecomment-928915155", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1566", "id": 928915155, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s43Xh7T", "user": {"login": "AlbertoUA", "id": 47592046, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NTkyMDQ2", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47592046?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA", "html_url": "https://github.com/AlbertoUA", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2021-09-28T07:06:02Z", "updated_at": "2021-09-28T07:06:02Z", "body": "When I try them separately, they both work. However, it is when I try them together that the first process launched always works  and the other fails. I have found that this does not happen all the time, but randomly depending on the execution.\r\n\r\nFor example, I am trying to launch 3 instances of PX4 with ports 14540, 14541 and 14542. And then I using the mavlink router to redirect the data to various ports.\r\n\r\n````\r\nmavlink-routerd -e 127.0.0.1.1.1:29990 -e 127.0.0.0.1:19990 127.0.0.1.1:14540 \r\n\r\nmavlink-routerd -e 127.0.0.0.1.1.1:29991 -e 127.0.0.0.1:19991 127.0.0.1.1:14541 \r\n\r\nmavlink-routerd -e 127.0.0.0.1.1.1:29992 -e 127.0.0.0.1.1:19992 127.0.0.1.1:14542 \r\n````\r\nNext, I connect multiple instances of mavskd processes to these ports in this order\r\n\r\ninstance of process 1 connected to port 29990\r\ninstance of process 1 connected to port 29991\r\ninstance of process 1 connected to port 29992\r\n\r\ninstance of process 2 connected to port 19990\r\ninstance of process 2 connected to port 19991\r\ninstance of process 2 connected to port 19992\r\n\r\nIn this case, all instances of process 1 are running correctly. However, some instances of process 2 will randomly fail because they are not able to find a system. Failing in this if:\r\n\r\n```c++\r\n if (fut.wait_for(std::chrono::seconds(5)) == std::future_status::timeout) {\r\n        RCLCPP_ERROR(this->get_logger(), \"No Autopilot found:\");\r\n        return false;\r\n    }\r\n````\r\nThe processes that fail are random and change between executions.\r\n\r\nI also tried to change the second process to mavros and got the same error (some processes dies randomly sometimes because it doesn't find any system).", "author_association": "NONE", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/928915155/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null, "event": "commented", "actor": {"login": "AlbertoUA", "id": 47592046, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NTkyMDQ2", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47592046?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA", "html_url": "https://github.com/AlbertoUA", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/929015944", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1566#issuecomment-929015944", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1566", "id": 929015944, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s43X6iI", "user": {"login": "JonasVautherin", "id": 2606672, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjI2MDY2NzI=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2606672?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin", "html_url": "https://github.com/JonasVautherin", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2021-09-28T09:24:46Z", "updated_at": "2021-09-28T09:24:46Z", "body": "One thing I can think of is that your different mavsdk instances should not have the same sysid:compid when connecting to the same drone. Not sure if that is your issue, but if not that will create issues later on, so let's try to change that first.\r\n\r\nI would use [this](https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/blob/main/src/core/mavsdk.h#L205-L206) to set manual sysid:compid (keep the boolean to false in that case)", "author_association": "COLLABORATOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/929015944/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null, "event": "commented", "actor": {"login": "JonasVautherin", "id": 2606672, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjI2MDY2NzI=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2606672?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin", "html_url": "https://github.com/JonasVautherin", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/929264706", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1566#issuecomment-929264706", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1566", "id": 929264706, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s43Y3RC", "user": {"login": "AlbertoUA", "id": 47592046, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NTkyMDQ2", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47592046?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA", "html_url": "https://github.com/AlbertoUA", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2021-09-28T14:06:27Z", "updated_at": "2021-09-28T14:06:27Z", "body": "I was able to find the problem. I used a code similar to the one on the [mission_fly](https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/blob/main/examples/fly_mission/fly_mission.cpp)  example where the system discovery function I has a code similar to this:\r\n```c++\r\nsdk_->subscribe_on_new_system([this, &prom]() {\r\n        auto system = sdk_->systems().back();\r\n        if (system->has_autopilot()) {\r\n````\r\nThis code takes the last system from the list of systems found by mavsdk. This works correctly when there is only one instance of mavsdk running because the autopilot is the only system found. However, when there is another instance from mavsdk running at the same time, this process is also discovered as a ground station without autopilot. As only the last system is processed by the code, no autopilot is found and the process fails.\r\n\r\nI have been able to make it working by iterating through all the systems found by mavsdk.\r\n````c++\r\nsdk_->subscribe_on_new_system([this, &prom]() {\r\n        for (auto const &system: sdk_->systems()) {\r\n            if (system->has_autopilot()) {\r\n````\r\n", "author_association": "NONE", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/929264706/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null, "event": "commented", "actor": {"login": "AlbertoUA", "id": 47592046, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NTkyMDQ2", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47592046?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA", "html_url": "https://github.com/AlbertoUA", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}}, {"id": 5374177461, "node_id": "CE_lADOBabE0s48GFpEzwAAAAFAU3C1", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/events/5374177461", "actor": {"login": "AlbertoUA", "id": 47592046, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NTkyMDQ2", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47592046?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA", "html_url": "https://github.com/AlbertoUA", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/AlbertoUA/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "event": "closed", "commit_id": null, "commit_url": null, "created_at": "2021-09-28T14:06:40Z", "state_reason": null, "intent": null, "performed_via_github_app": null}], "fetched_at": "2026-08-28T20:38:35Z"}